Let $f\in \Lg{\gamma}$, $\gamma > 3$, 
let $X$ be the $(\beta,\sigma_\pm)$-OSBM solution to~\eqref{eq:OSBM}.

Then there exists (possibly on an extension of the probability space) a BM $B$ independent of $X$ such that
\begin{equation} \label{th:gen:jacod:eq}
\begin{split}
